Subject: Make tweak registry pool destruction visible in optimized native builds

Upstream-base: f75ccf1ad20e5bd7585962990db08067c0ae498a

Native exception cleanup for InitializeTweakRegistry instantiates the fixed
slot-pool destructors in this translation unit. Include their existing original
inline definition instead of relying on another object emitting a copy.

diff --git a/src/Game/TweakRegistry.cpp b/src/Game/TweakRegistry.cpp
--- a/src/Game/TweakRegistry.cpp
+++ b/src/Game/TweakRegistry.cpp
@@ -1,4 +1,7 @@
 #include "Game/TweakRegistry.h"
+#ifdef MSCHARGED_NATIVE
+#include "NL/nlSlotPoolFixed.inl"
+#endif
 
 #include "Game/SharedStaticStorage.h"
 
